<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Wesfi year net profit plunges.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Wesfi year net profit plunges.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.99 vs 15.51</p>
<p>    Net					1.42 vs 10.60</p>
